Third-party data
----------------

inst/extdata/prahl-hemoglobin-v1.csv (with its manifest
inst/extdata/prahl-hemoglobin-v1.json) contains the hemoglobin molar
extinction coefficient table compiled by Scott Prahl from data by
W. B. Gratzer and N. Kollias, as redistributed in MNE-Python v1.10.2
(mne/data/extinction_coef.mat).

